{title: Drunken Sailor}
{artist: Námořnická píseň}
{key: Dmi}

{start_of_verse: label="1."}
[Dmi]What shall we do with a drunken sailor,
[C]what shall we do with a drunken sailor,
[Dmi]what shall we do with a drunken sailor
[C]early in the [Dmi]morning?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Dmi]Way hay and up she rises,
[C]way hay and up she rises,
[Dmi]way hay and up she rises
[C]early in the [Dmi]morning.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: label="2."}
[Dmi]Put him in the long boat till he's sober,
[C]put him in the long boat till he's sober,
[Dmi]put him in the long boat till he's sober
[C]early in the [Dmi]morning.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: label="3."}
[Dmi]Shave his belly with a rusty razor,
[C]shave his belly with a rusty razor,
[Dmi]shave his belly with a rusty razor
[C]early in the [Dmi]morning.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
